{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/en.png?t=1744248479\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to wishlist the full game Pixel Dungeon VR to continue your most fun dungeon adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong>Complete special in-game tasks to win exclusive rewards!</strong> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/0.gif?t=1744248479\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc50 Solo or Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo or 3-player team-up. Co-op multiplayer enhances your social experience with smarter battle strategies, real-time teammate guidance, and integrated voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/1.gif?t=1744248479\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd4c Endless Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore randomly generated dungeons in pixel world, offering a new challenge with each adventure. Discover elite rooms, intricate mazes, and easter egg chambers! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/2.gif?t=1744248479\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Immersive Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose, mix and match from 10+ types of weapons\u2014snipe with a crossbow, wield a heavy sword, throw axes, wield a magic wand... and face off against unique monsters and epic boss in a non-stop thrill ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194310/extras/3.gif?t=1744248479\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udddd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Diverse Avatars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with 30, more avatars designs to be determined by players. Unleash your imagination &amp; share your ideas in Discord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Growth System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Talent</strong>: Utilize the talent system to upgrade different abilities, enhance combat prowess, unlock new skills and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Crafting</strong>: Forge your own legendary gear by upgrading weapons or rerolling their attributes.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ABSOLUTE DEFENSE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/ea32e38ca9e835e00cea3c1ceff86533000e2873.jpg"},{"name":"SKELETON KING SLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/7b056587eae7ae601e837780f82dbb2e3410f109.jpg"},{"name":"LORD OF GHOST SLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/b4cc5c86c1314e08e36baa3ed59b9b1bb3eb7365.jpg"},{"name":"DEMOLITION EXPERT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/0908a1f6ca88d353df45397bb27d757d27ac1806.jpg"},{"name":"FORBIDDEN KNOWLEDGE MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/6c0e606865924bba14050f85da0ff0a24a45e260.jpg"},{"name":"DUNGEON HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/a5311a7d0638477ca59d03cc9355d978849ead34.jpg"},{"name":"FOODIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/e17861c43beb46ae7b894fcc1c70f0e32ae7e79a.jpg"},{"name":"THE MAGIC TOUCH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/bd64a54f1da5502f9c44bac9a0184b5b0ee0722a.jpg"},{"name":"WAR CORRESPONDENT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3194310/da